WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The robot arm moves from the top center towards the cabinet on the right. It approaches the middle drawer handle, grasps it, and pulls it outward to open the drawer. The arm then retracts slightly while the drawer remains open.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Move arm towards the middle drawer handle of the cabinet

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Grasp the drawer handle and pull it open

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.800
Retract arm away from the open drawer
